        "label": "Our philosophy",
        "heading": "Experimentation isn't a method. It's the point.",
        "text": "<p>We take cues from fashion scenes around the world and run them through our own lens. We refuse to settle into one category — every collection explores a new idea, and every pair gets its own name and personality.</p><p>Futuristic one season, vintage the next. Never boring.</p>",
