        "label": "What we promise",
        "heading": "More than an accessory.",
        "text": "<p>Good design is only half the job. Every order ships within 24 hours, cash on delivery works everywhere in India, and a real person answers on WhatsApp.</p><p>Quality, customer experience and meticulous design — that's the whole brief.</p>",
